		"name": "OpenRegister inOrEmpty list filter",
		"description": "# inOrEmpty list filter\n\nopenspec/changes/search-value-or-empty-filter task 2.1: `?<property>_inOrEmpty[]=<value>` (and `<property>[inOrEmpty][]=`) returns the objects whose property is one of the values or has no value (missing, null, empty string, empty array), with the page, the total and the next page computed on the same condition. A plain `in` filter is the control: it leaves the objects without a value out.\n\nSeeds its own register: 12 characters in Aldoria, 5 in Norheim, 3 with no setting; three items with a list property. Removes the register at the end.",
